Cell["\<\
Hamiltonian and overlap block lists must have matching dimensions and layer \
order.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1719463475,ExpressionUUID->"c70b138a-8bdc-984d-bdea-0a2cbc7dd920"],

Cell["\<\
All sigmas are attached to the last layer. \"T\" returns its diagonal block; \
\"LDOS\" and \"LCDV\" return the final column in reverse layer order.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2038375234,ExpressionUUID->"e6f922b1-f415-2a42-9df1-2018a10f193a"],

Cell["\<\
At complex energy the transformed upper overlap coupling is computed \
separately, preserving z rather than Conjugate[z].\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->954128863,ExpressionUUID->"8dae97d5-ac9b-cb49-a99b-f751f3e99226"]
}, Closed]],

